aph_id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p013","quote":"於是王乃使人馳而往問泉陽令曰：「漁者幾何家？名誰為豫且？豫且得龜，見夢於王，王故使我求之。」泉陽令乃使吏案籍視圖，水上漁者五十五家，上流之廬，名為豫且。泉陽令曰：「諾。」乃與使者馳而問豫且曰：「今昔汝漁何得？」豫且曰：「夜半時舉網得龜。」使者曰：「今龜安在？」曰：「在籠中。」使者曰：「王知子得龜，故使我求之。」豫且曰：「諾。」即繋龜而出之籠中，獻使者。"}],"source_term":"水上漁者五十五家，上流之廬，名為豫且","interpretation_note":"住所依原句上流之廬保存，泉陽背景保留於同段證據，不拼接原文沒有的地名，不推現代轄區。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013","text":"策好馳騁遊獵，翻諫曰：\"明府用烏集之眾，驅散附之士，皆得其死力，雖漢高帝不及也。至於輕出微行，從官不暇嚴，吏卒常苦之。夫君人者不重則不威，故曰龍魚服，困於豫且，白蛇自放，劉季害之，願少留意。\"策曰：\"君言是也，然時有所思，端坐悒悒，有裨諶草創之計，是以行耳。\"翻出為富春長。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"策","kind":"person","person_id":"e9c_070_567","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"翻","kind":"person","person_id":"izi_e36_p1g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013:m0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"漢高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013:m0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"豫且","kind":"person","person_id":"uiq_fxy_s78","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013:m0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"劉季","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013:m0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"策","kind":"person","person_id":"e9c_070_567","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013:m0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"裨諶","kind":"person","person_id":"qc3_jv1_tig","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013:m0130","start":130,"end":131,"surface":"翻","kind":"person","person_id":"izi_e36_p1g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":13,"last_line":13,"revision_id":2638131,"raw_start":663,"raw_end":1803,"character_positions":[665,666,667,668,669,670,671,672,673,674,675,676,677,678,679,680,681,682,683,684,685,686,687,688,689,690,691,692,693,694,695,696,697,698,699,700,701,702,703,704,705,706,707,708,709,710,711,712,713,714,715,716,717,718,719,720,721,722,723,724,725,726,727,728,729,730,731,732,733,734,735,736,737,738,739,740,741,742,743,744,745,746,747,748,749,750,751,752,753,754,755,756,757,758,759,760,761,762,763,764,765,766,767,768,769,770,771,772,773,774,775,776,777,778,779,780,781,782,783,784,785,786,787,788,789,790,791,792,793,794,1796,1797,1798,1799,1800,1801,1802]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-057","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-057-yufan"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p012","text":"宋元王二年，江使神龜使於河，至於泉陽，漁者豫且舉網得而囚之。置之籠中。夜半，龜來見夢於宋元王曰：「我為江使於河，而幕網當吾路。泉陽豫且得我，我不能去。身在患中，莫可告語。王有德義，故來告訴。」元王惕然而悟。乃召博士衛平而問之曰：「今寡人夢見一丈夫，延頸而長頭，衣玄繡之衣而乘輜車，來見夢於寡人曰：『我為江使於河，而幕網當吾路。泉陽豫且得我，我不能去。身在患中，莫可告語。王有德義，故來告訴。』是何物也？」衛平乃援式而起，仰天而視月之光，觀斗所指，定日處鄉。規矩為輔，副以權衡。四維已定，八卦相望。視其吉凶，介蟲先見。乃對元王曰：「今昔壬子，宿在牽牛。河水大會，鬼神相謀。漢正南北，江河固期，南風新至，江使先來。白雲壅漢，萬物盡留。斗柄指日，使者當囚。玄服而乘輜車，其名為龜。王急使人問而求之。」王曰：「善。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"宋元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"神龜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"豫且","kind":"person","person_id":"uiq_fxy_s78","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"宋元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"豫且","kind":"person","person_id":"uiq_fxy_s78","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"豫且","kind":"person","person_id":"uiq_fxy_s78","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0260","start":260,"end":262,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","book_id":"b-shiji-128","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p013","text":"於是王乃使人馳而往問泉陽令曰：「漁者幾何家？名誰為豫且？豫且得龜，見夢於王，王故使我求之。」泉陽令乃使吏案籍視圖，水上漁者五十五家，上流之廬，名為豫且。泉陽令曰：「諾。」乃與使者馳而問豫且曰：「今昔汝漁何得？」豫且曰：「夜半時舉網得龜。」使者曰：「今龜安在？」曰：「在籠中。」使者曰：「王知子得龜，故使我求之。」豫且曰：「諾。」即繋龜而出之籠中，獻使者。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m013-0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m013-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"泉陽令","kind":"person","person_id":"4sb_h3r_tey","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m013-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"豫且","kind":"person","person_id":"uiq_fxy_s78","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-12